decided to throw themselves onto a level teleporter trap.  This is not
good.  These guys did all my "heavy lifting" and general dirty work (i.e. 
fighting).  And one of 'em just polished off a shopkeeper, which is way
beyond my means at the moment, being that I have no offensive capability
save a wand o' sleep.  My guess is that when I find 'em they will be
peaceful at best, or will they be hostile??  If so, I hope not to run 
into 'em any time soon.

Also, after the first one was teleported, why would the second one jump 
onto a known trap spot?

Who else out there also enjoys having a couple of strong-arm buddies along
to soften up those big nasties?  I take great delight in trying to get a
nice little army to go along with me on my escapades.  Any other tales
involving fun with pets?  What are some of your favorite/unique
combinations of/strangest pets? 

